# Phase 0 smoke test: stock PolarFire SoC FreeRTOS+lwIP demo, headless; runs 3 s of virtual time and quits.
# Self-contained equivalent of scripts/single-node/polarfire-soc.resc using the local image in ../images.
#
# Run:  renode --console --disable-gui freertos-smoke.resc < /dev/null
# UART output: logs/freertos-mmuart0.log

using sysbus
mach create "pse"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/polarfire-soc.repl

# Errors only; at WARNING level this demo writes several GB of log in a few seconds.
logLevel 3

sysbus LoadELF $ORIGIN/../images/pse-freertos-lwip.elf

mmuart0 CreateFileBackend $ORIGIN/logs/freertos-mmuart0.log true
emulation RunFor "3"
q
